## Tracked bridge expansions

Const-trait substrate bridges deferred from round 202605021800 (Round 1) to later rounds within PR #42:

- ConstFrom\<T\> / ConstTryFrom\<T, E\> substrate bridge. **SHIPPED in round 202605031548 (#314).** See `## ConstFrom and ConstTryFrom bridges` in DESIGN.md.tmpl.
- ConstDeref / ConstAsRef\<T\> substrate bridge, placed in arvo-transparent. **SHIPPED in round 202605031548 (#314).** See `arvo-transparent/DESIGN.md.tmpl`.
- ConstHash\<N, S, Sign\> + NarrowFromU64\<N, S, Sign\> (placed in arvo-hash + arvo-bits-contracts respectively). **SHIPPED in round 202605031548 (#314).** Replaces the per-N `hash_const` inherent pattern with a focused trait contract; collapses 128 hand-written `Hasher<N>` impl bodies to 2 bounded-generic blocks. See `arvo-hash/DESIGN.md.tmpl`.
- ConstTry / ConstControlFlow\<R, O\>. Replaces non-const stdlib Try / FromResidual for ? on Bool in const context. Lands in Round 5 (#315). Surfaces from Expert B Finding 21.

